// depends-on-plugin com.intellij.java
// depends-on-plugin org.intellij.groovy
//
// Script-variable bindings (LivePlugin script).
//
// SCOPE
//   Only .groovy use-sites under kubegroovy/{startup,client,server}_scripts/**.
//
// WHAT IT DOES
//   Reads the project's local/kubegroovy/live-plugin/bindings/bindings.json,
//   generated by /kgy generate-typings
//   from the runtime binding snapshot, keyed by script side, and teaches the
//   editor the implicit script variables, e.g. $Item, $StartupEvents, SECOND.
//   Three mechanisms, all side-gated by file path (startup_scripts,
//   server_scripts, client_scripts):
//     variables  a NonCodeMembersContributor emits the instance and
//                event-group bindings of the file's side as implicit
//                GrDynamicImplicitProperty values, so they resolve with no
//                imports (event groups as EventGroupBinding, instances as T).
//     imports    a GrImportContributor exposes class-value bindings as
//                implicit aliased imports, matching the engine autoimports.
//     completion a CompletionContributor offers the class-value aliases
//                without adding import statements to the document.
//
// LOOKUP / COST
//   Entries are indexed once per file change into Map<side, List<entry>>;
//   All providers bail fast outside KubeGroovy script dirs; variable and
//   completion providers also skip qualified references.
//
// RUNNING IT
//   compile.bat checks it compiles; install.bat copies script + logos to
//   LivePlugin; reload it from the LivePlugin tool window.

